    "text": "hallmarktimes.com\nwebsite\nCave City\nHeroes for Hope 5K Set for October 11 in Cave City\nBy News Release,\n7 hours agoCave City, AR — Lace up your running shoes, grab your cape, and get ready to make a difference! The CALL in Sharp and Independence Counties and the Sharp County Sheriff Foundation are excited to host the Heroes for Hope 5K on Saturday, October 11, 2025, at 9:00 AM at Cave City Park.",
